# Identifying Food-Related Values of Low-Income Mothers

**Authors:** Suter, Carol B., Barbour, Helen F.

## Abstract
Before nutrition educators can effectively create behavioral changes in food selection, preparation, and consumption by low-income mothers, the mothers' food-related values must be determined. The article describes a study to determine such values. (A G)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ117056

